{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porta-Tower is a roguelike tower defense game where you can pick up and move your towers to better cover the enemies' path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move Your Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower's placement is important, so when a position becomes suboptimal, pick it up and move it! How much you want to move them will depend on what type of towers you have. Long-ranged towers can be left alone for longer, while short-ranged towers will need to be moved more frequently to stay in range of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/extras/42dad9a7d5dd3b4a5e81bcfee41257f0.poster.avif?t=1770704602\" width=1000 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/extras/42dad9a7d5dd3b4a5e81bcfee41257f0.webm?t=1770704602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/extras/42dad9a7d5dd3b4a5e81bcfee41257f0.mp4?t=1770704602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you've gathered enough crystals, move your tower to the upgrader and upgrade it. Be careful, though, as moving a tower to the upgrader will take it out of the defense until you put it back in position.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2180950?t=1770704602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2180950?t=1770704602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/c65f8e2eb826a8b74473bba81107248d4a317f43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770704602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/c65f8e2eb826a8b74473bba81107248d4a317f43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770704602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porta-Tower is a roguelike tower defense game where you can pick up and move your towers to better cover the enemies' path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move Your Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower's placement is important, so when a position becomes suboptimal, pick it up and move it! How much you want to move them will depend on what type of towers you have. Long-ranged towers can be left alone for longer, while short-ranged towers will need to be moved more frequently to stay in range of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/extras/42dad9a7d5dd3b4a5e81bcfee41257f0.poster.avif?t=1770704602\" width=1000 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/extras/42dad9a7d5dd3b4a5e81bcfee41257f0.webm?t=1770704602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/extras/42dad9a7d5dd3b4a5e81bcfee41257f0.mp4?t=1770704602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you've gathered enough crystals, move your tower to the upgrader and upgrade it. Be careful, though, as moving a tower to the upgrader will take it out of the defense until you put it back in position.</p>","developers":["Novadisc Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/3018ebbd497a412b4d0a75c8cfb08acbaf020ba3/header.jpg?t=1770704602","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Porta-Tower","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Novadisc Games Inc."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"April 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/316619bc0ed547459ad272e4bd18909705b41e8d/ss_316619bc0ed547459ad272e4bd18909705b41e8d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770704602","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/316619bc0ed547459ad272e4bd18909705b41e8d/ss_316619bc0ed547459ad272e4bd18909705b41e8d.600x338.jpg?t=1770704602"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/e261a520734a8a6a5e1d4898026be65911a1d1f1/ss_e261a520734a8a6a5e1d4898026be65911a1d1f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770704602","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/e261a520734a8a6a5e1d4898026be65911a1d1f1/ss_e261a520734a8a6a5e1d4898026be65911a1d1f1.600x338.jpg?t=1770704602"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180950/8417739ad734bf79f78239249ed367c5f5631f70/ss_8417739ad734bf79f782